// Map trigger on the plateau after the king marches (verc_north).
@speaker The stakes
=== start
[quest pit active] -> failed
Black stakes in a row along the inside of the rampart, where the ground is scorched in circles. The ash has been rained on. Nobody walks this way who doesn't have to.
* Walk on. -> END

=== failed
~ quest pit failed failed; set pit_closed
Black stakes in a row along the inside of the rampart, where the ground is scorched in circles. The pit past the granaries is empty.

The king marched north, and before he went he carried out his sentences. You were too slow, or you chose not to be quick. Either way, Eppillos burned.
* Walk on. -> END
